# RoyalRushStrongMan1 (18158, Executioner of Halisha, level 81), every draw 0, the clock at 00:53:30:
# created, it wants its self buff (4318) on itself. A character that hits it twice makes it want
# its first physical special (4582) on the character; a mate that hits it makes it blast around
# itself (4621). Its 6001 timer, every minute, takes it out of the world once the clock reads
# minute 55; a death leaves a Key Box (31455) where it fell.
clock 00:53:30
character Hunter 20
random always 0
member Mate 20 -1500 0 0
script script.ai.individual.DefaultNpc
script script.ai.individual.Monster.MonsterAI
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.WarriorBase
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.Warrior
script script.ai.individual.Monster.WarriorBase.Warrior.RoyalRushStrongMan1
npc sm 18158 Monster 100 0 0 level 81 skill SELF_BUFF 4318 1 skill PHYSICAL_SPECIAL1 4582 9 skill SELF_RANGE_DD_MAGIC1 4621 9
npc keybox 31455 Folk 5000 0 0

advance 1s
  desires sm attack(player)=200 cast(sm,4318,move)=1000000
hit sm 10
  desires sm attack(player)=211.36363636363637 cast(player,4582,move)=1000000 cast(sm,4318,move)=1000000
hit sm 10 by Mate
  desires sm attack(player)=211.36363636363637 attack(Mate)=11.363636363636363 cast(player,4582,move)=1000000 cast(sm,4318,move)=1000000 cast(sm,4621,move)=1000000
advance 1m
  inworld sm yes
advance 1m
  S DeleteObject obj=sm
  inworld sm no
